# This directory stores saved .pt and .onnx model weight files.
# Place your trained model checkpoints here.
#
# Expected files:
#   - efficientnetv2_s.pt       (PyTorch FP32 checkpoint)
#   - efficientnetv2_s.onnx     (ONNX FP32 export)
#   - efficientnetv2_s_int8.onnx (ONNX INT8 quantized)
#   - mobilevit_xs.pt           (PyTorch FP32 checkpoint)
#   - mobilevit_xs.onnx         (ONNX FP32 export)
#   - mobilevit_xs_int8.onnx    (ONNX INT8 quantized)
